{"seq":4,"slug":"hdr-wide-gamut","title":"HDR 与宽色域","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hdr-standards","title":"HDR 标准体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut/hdr-standards","wordCount":3499,"readingTime":14},{"seq":2,"slug":"wide-color-gamut","title":"宽色域色彩空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut/wide-color-gamut","wordCount":3519,"readingTime":15},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-format-delivery","title":"多格式交付与适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/hdr-wide-gamut/multi-format-delivery","wordCount":3965,"readingTime":16}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"hdr-与宽色域-简介\">HDR 与宽色域 简介</h1><p>HDR（High Dynamic Range，高动态范围）和宽色域（Wide Color Gamut）代表着显示技术的最前沿，要求调色工作流从色彩科学、监看环境到输出标准全面升级。传统 SDR/Rec.709 工作流已无法满足现代 HDR 显示器的能力。</p>\n<p>本章系统介绍 HDR 标准体系（HDR10、Dolby Vision、HLG）、宽色域色彩空间（DCI-P3、Rec.2020）的技术原理，以及面向多种显示设备的适配输出策略。掌握 HDR 调色是专业调色师的核心竞争力之一。</p>\n"}